	der. Look for the logo on the Find Tickets page to view all available acce
	ssible seats. We do have accessible seating in every price range but be ad
	vised it may sell out. We have very limited seating available for guests o
	n the day of the event so please make sure you purchase accessible seating
	 when you order tickets. Bags up to 12" x 6" x 12" are allowed in the venu
